<title>UK: RVI International sets $50 mln bond with warrants.</title>
<headline>RVI International sets $50 mln bond with warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by lead manager Yamaichi International (Europe) Limited.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RVI INTERNATIONAL LIMITED</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  THE FUJI BANK LIMITED</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    04.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 WARRANTS  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    04.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	IND PREM   2.50</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50     PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	*US/UK/JP/CAYMAN</p>
<p>		 TWO WARRANTS PER BOND TO SUBSCRIBE FOR SHARES OF</p>
<p>		 COMMON STOCK OF RIKEN VINYL INDUSTRY CO LTD. NUMBER</p>
<p>		 OF SHARES PER WARRANT AND SUBSCRIPTION PRICE TO BE</p>
<p>		 FIXED ON PRICING. PRICING DATE 17.SEP.96</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
